# Universal Telegram Bot Configuration
# 1. Obtain TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN by messaging @BotFather on Telegram (/newbot)
# 2. Start a conversation with your bot (/start)
# 3. Obtain TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (send a message, then run: tg-cli status)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id_here
